# Cursor Rules: AP Physics C Walkthroughs

This project uses the `ap-physics-walkthrough` agent skill.
For detailed rule configuration, see `.cursor/rules/ap-physics-walkthrough.mdc`.

## Quick Command
To build or update a unit from Question and Answer PDFs:
```bash
python3 skills/ap-physics-walkthrough/scripts/run_unit_pipeline.py \
  --unit <N> \
  --title "<Unit Title>" \
  --questions <questions.pdf> \
  --answers <answers.pdf>
```

## Invariants
- Additive only: Never touch `unit2/` or `unit4/`.
- Symbols first: Explain variable before formula.
- Left-aligned KaTeX (`fleqn: true`).
- Audio files generated as MP3s with `manifest.json`.
- Verification command: `python3 skills/ap-physics-walkthrough/scripts/verify_unit.py --unit <N>`.
